# Local IPOs: a business's yearly earnings are its share of the income the game reports for its
# zone. Logs, for shops, offices and industry, that income, what the shares add back up to, and the
# range of offering prices the city's businesses would list at. Reads only; changes nothing.
name local ipos: earnings share out the zone's real income and give an offering price
ipo-income
expect-log ipo income Commercial
expect-log ipo income Office
expect-log ipo income Industrial
